It is evening.
Mette is here again.
"Are you happy here, Maya?" Mette asks.
"Yes, I am very happy," I say.
"Copenhagen is lovely," I say.
"But everything is new and a little difficult," I say.
"That is okay," Mette says. "I am your friend."
"Thank you, Mette. You are kind," I say.
Now I am not alone.
I am new in Denmark.
But Copenhagen is my new home.
And Mette is my first friend.
